{"title": "读超时 2s 触发 504 现场", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location / { proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9001; }"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "proxy_read_timeout 2s;"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "静默后端：sleep 60 | nc -l -p 9001，收请求不回字节"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code} %{time_total}s' localhost/"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "504 2.004539s"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "整 2 秒被掐断，多一秒都没等——这就是读超时的准头"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "错误日志同步记下："},
  {"t": "out", "s": "upstream timed out (110: Operation timed out) while"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "reading response header from upstream"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5（docker nginx:alpine 容器）"}
]}
